<urn:atm:triage:finding/AY8-QA-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AY8-QA-002" ;
  triage:title "D7 fake socket server (crates/atm-herdr/tests/support/fake_herdr_socket/mod.rs) is unwired dead code; required scenario matrix absent" ;
  triage:description "FakeHerdrSocket implements only bind/serve_once; grep confirms it is never referenced by any test. Required scenarios are entirely absent: absent endpoint, late start, no-newline response, oversized response, stalled connect/write/read, rejected second request on one connection, Windows pipe-busy with paused Tokio time, 17-caller saturation proving resource release, and cancellation at permit-wait/connect/write/read. AY.2 version-recording replay through the fixture is absent. D7 acceptance criterion unfulfilled." ;
